[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0010","text":"路加，辛苦了\n在我看来，这是一场非常棒的演出"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0020","text":"回去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0030","text":"别跟我\\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0040","text":"……\n你小心点……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0042","text":"路人1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0050","text":"搞什么啊，下雨了～……\n我还赌它不会下呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0051","text":"路人2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0060","text":"真不走运～……\n没带伞，午饭去便利店买了在公司吃？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0062","text":"路加的SNS投稿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0070","text":"『下雨　老是这种破事』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0072","text":"路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0080","text":"所以，那又怎样──────\n……跟我没关系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0090","text":"我…………只是去我想去的地方────────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600400_03_0100","text":"好冷──────"}]
